nGurukrupa Marina Enclave is a residential complex located in the Malad West suburb of Mumbai, India. It is a gated community that offers modern amenities and facilities to its residents, such as a swimming pool, landscaped gardens, children's play area, gymnasium, and clubhouse.   \n  \nThe complex comprises of 2 and 3 BHK apartments in multiple towers and is situated in close proximity to the Western Express Highway, Malad railway station.  \n  \nIt offers apartments in varied budget range. These units are a perfect combination of comfort and style, specifically designed to suit your requirements and conveniences.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Gurukrupa Marina Enclave Malad West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Gurukrupa Marina Enclave in Malad West, Mumbai - Image 467237](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/1646/BHK_Configuration/c84a993c4f3686d5f056fe8200897d3e.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n634 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n1.75 Cr\n\n![3 BHK Flat in Gurukrupa Marina Enclave in Malad West, Mumbai - Image 467238](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/1646/BHK_Configuration/902c3536f9199acec60d20d38e42e8b1.webp)\n\n3 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n838 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n2.55 Cr\n\n## Key Features of Gurukrupa Marina Enclave Malad West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Artistic Structure.\n* MIni Theatre.\n* Beautiful Vitrified Flooring.\n* Top-Notch Amenities.\n* Modern Gymnasium.\n* Modern Community Living.\n\n## Amenities Gurukrupa Marina Enclave Malad West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Swimming Pool\n* Gymnasium\n* Kids Play Area\n* Indoor Games\n* Cricket Ground\n* Multipurpose Play Court\n* Jogging Track\n* Cycle Track\n* Squash Court\n\n* Lift\n* Security\n* Power Back Up\n* Party Hall\n* Yoga Room\n* Meditation Zone\n* Children Playing Zone\n* Senior Citizen Sitting Area\n* Senior Citizens' Walking Track\n* Multipurpose Hall\n* Society Office\n* Gazebo\n* Convenience Store\n* Jacuzzi\n\n* Community Club\n* Recreation/Kids Club\n* Pool Deck With Sun\n* Swimming Pool\n* Indoor Kids' Play Area\n* Indoor Games And Activities\n* Vastu-compliant designs\n* Mini Theatre\n* Nature Walkway\n\n* Cctv Surveillance\n* Entrance Gate With Security\n* Fire Fighting System\n* 24/7 Security\n\n* Themed Landscape Garden\n* Mo Sewage Treatment Plant\n* Eco Life\n* Drip Irrigation System\n\n* Marble flooring\n* Modular kitchen\n* Premium sanitary and CP fittings\n* Vitrified tile flooring\n* Stainless steel sink\n* Anti-skid Ceramic Tiles\n* Concealed Electrification\n* Concealed Plumbing\n* Laminated Flush Doors\n\n## Walkthrough video Gurukrupa Marina Enclave Malad West\n\n## Google Map Location of Gurukrupa Marina Enclave Malad West\n\n## Locality Overview of Malad West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n[Malad West](/location-review/mumbai/malad-west-real-estate-guide) is a fast-developing residential area in Mumbai, preferred for its open surroundings and improving connectivity. The locality offers access to daily conveniences such as schools, healthcare facilities, and retail options within the broader Malad West region.\n\nWith increasing residential development and infrastructure growth, Malad West is often considered by buyers looking for affordable housing and long-term value.\n\n## RERA QR codes\n\n---\n\nGurukrupa Marina Enclave is a real estate project registered under Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority, ensuring transparency and accountability in its development. Scan the RERA QR code or search for the project here: <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/>\n\n---\n\nRera No.:  [P51800032311](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800032311)\n\nProject: Gurukrupa Marina Enclave\n\n## Explore Neighbourhood Gurukrupa Marina Enclave Malad West\n\n---\n\n* Vidya Vikas Universal College\n* Shri M.D. Shah Mahila College\n* Children Welfare Centre Law College\n* Witty International School\n\n* Hayyat Multispeciality hospital\n* Jankanyan Charitable Hospital\n* Sun Multispeciality Hospital\n* Saraswati Hospital\n\n* The Mall\n* Vasant Plaza\n* Growel 101 Mall\n* Hypercity Mall\n\n* Monopoly\n* Udipi Shree Krishna\n* Mozzarella Pizza Hub\n* Domino's Pizza\n\n![Gurukrupa Group](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Developer/FirmLogos/872_1678040181_gg.webp)\n\n## [Gurukrupa Group](/mumbai/sale/builder/gurukrupa-group-872)\n\nOngoing Projects: 3\n\nCompleted Projects: 20\n\nTotal Projects: 23\n\n---\n\nGurukrupa Group of Mumbai, founded in 1994, boasts an extensive and distinguished history of experience in the real estate industry. With numerous projects, the company has gained a reputation for promptly delivering top-notch quality. Its completed projects include names such as Gurukrupa Arcade, Gurukrupa CHS, and Gurukrupa Vasant, amongst others.  \n   \nThe company's current ongoing projects include the likes of Gurukrupa SAI Residency and Gurukrupa Aishwarya. With an unwavering focus on innovation and excellence, Gurukrupa Group continues pushing the boundaries of Mumbai's real estate development.  \n  \n[Properties in Mumbai by Gurukrupa Group](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/builder/gurukrupa-group-872), [Properties in Navi Mumbai by Gurukrupa Group](https://houssed.com/navi.mumbai/sale/builder/gurukrupa-group-872), [Properties in Thane by Gurukrupa Group](https://houssed.com/thane/sale/builder/gurukrupa-group-872)\n\n## About Gurukrupa Marina Enclave, Mumbai, Malad West\n\n---\n\nGurukrupa Marina Enclave in Malad West, Mumbai, is a well-planned residential community by the Gurukrupa Group, designed for comfortable city living. The project offers thoughtfully laid-out 1, 2, and 3 BHK homes that suit the needs of families, working professionals, and long-term residents. With daily conveniences, green open spaces, and lifestyle facilities like a clubhouse, gym, and swimming pool, life here feels balanced and practical.\n\nLocated close to SV Road and Malad railway station, the project enjoys smooth connectivity to key parts of Mumbai. The surrounding area has schools, hospitals, shopping zones, and offices within easy reach. As a ready-to-move development with families already residing, Gurukrupa Marina Enclave stands out for those looking for [**Premium flats in Malad West**](https://houssed.com/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/segment/premium) that combine everyday comfort with reliable connectivity and a well-established neighbourhood.\n\n## **Why Homebuyers Prefer This Project**\n\n* Practical home layouts that support daily routines\n* Calm residential surroundings with reduced noise\n* Easy access to daily needs like shops and clinics\n* Few minutes by car get you where people go to earn their pay. Roads stay clear most times of day. Getting around feels smooth when heading toward job spots close by\n* Lasting on its own, built more for staying a while than just passing through\n* A record of reliable results stands behind this builder. Their past projects show what to expect now\n\n## **The Neighbourhood & Surroundings**\n\nA stone's throw from bustling streets, Gurukrupa Marina Enclave sits quietly in Malad West, where city living feels just right. Life here moves without hassle thanks to nearby grocers, markets, and medical spots tucked into the block. Schools and colleges pop up around corners, handy for students and parents alike. Step a little further, and familiar hubs like [Goregaon](https://houssed.com/mumbai-goregaon.east/sale/flats) or [Andheri West](https://houssed.com/mumbai-andheri.west/sale/flats) open up with ease. Even Kandarpada side and [Jogeshwari](https://houssed.com/mumbai-jogeshwari.west/sale/flats) hum within reach, stitching everything together.\n\nHomes sit beside busy lanes where people walk dogs, buy fruit, ride bikes. Though shops hum and cinemas glow at night, quiet corners remain between trees and old buildings. People raising kids often stay here because schools feel close, roads seem safe, life moves without rush. Workers return after office hours to find traffic light, paths clear, neighbors familiar. Living here means less hassle getting around, more time doing what matters.\n\n## **Connectivity & Daily Travel Convenience**\n\nConnectivity from this project is straightforward and manageable. Malad West is well linked through major roads that connect easily to Andheri, Goregaon, and other western suburbs. Public transport options such as buses, autos, and app-based cabs are available throughout the day, making daily travel convenient for residents.\n\nRailway stations on the Western line are easily accessible for regular office commutes, reducing dependence on private vehicles. This ease of movement especially benefits families and buyers looking for [**3BHK flats in Malad West**](https://houssed.com/mumbai-malad.west/sale/flats/3bhk), where smooth daily travel to work, schools, and shopping areas helps households plan their routines without unnecessary stress.\n\n## **How the Local Real Estate Market Is Performing**\n\nYears have passed, yet Malad West property keeps drawing interest, mostly from people who live there and those commuting to jobs. Space matters, but so does cost - mid-range homes often hit the sweet spot for buyers. Close to workplaces, shops, and buses or trains, it stays a go-to for renters too.\n\nSlow shifts in prices here point to steadiness over sudden jumps. This part of town tends to keep property owners for years, not months. Stability shows up more than quick deals do around these streets.\n\n## **Price Trends of Real Estate in Malad West**\n\nThe table below shows an estimated overview of how residential prices in Malad West have moved over recent years, reflecting steady and gradual growth.\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| **Year (April-June)** | **Price/Sq ft** |\n| 2021 | Rs. 22,750 |\n| 2022 | Rs. 24,000 |\n| 2023 | Rs. 25,550 |\n| 2024 | Rs. 26,300 |\n| 2025 | Rs. 28,000 |\n\n## **Is This Project Worth Investing In?**\n\nStability draws those eyeing [Gurukrupa Marina Enclave](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/builder/gurukrupa-group-872) Malad West, Mumbai - fast profits aren’t the highlight here. Prospects of consistent rent come alive through professionals tied to business hubs close by. Easy access to transit and everyday needs keeps tenants sticking around. Long haul living finds footing where location meets routine.\n\nFew surprises draw people here - just steady changes that favor those wanting stability instead of quick wins. New developments keep coming, yet the area holds its familiar shape, appealing to careful minds looking for slow, clear progress rather than sudden leaps.\n\n## **Rapid Infrastructure Development in Malad West**\n\n|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **School Name** | **Healthcare Name** | **Entertainment Venues** |\n| **Orchids The International School** | **Cloudnine Hospital** (Specialized Care) | **Inorbit Mall** (Premium Retail) |\n| **Witty International School** | **Zenith Multispeciality Hospital** | **Infiniti Mall** (Shopping & Fun City) |\n| **Billabong High International** | **Surana Hospital & Research Centre** | **INOX Megaplex** (Inorbit Mall) |\n| **Ryan International School** (CBSE/ICSE) | **Lifeline Multispeciality Hospital** | **Timezone** (Gaming Hub) |\n| **Dr. S. Radhakrishnan International** | **Vivanta Multi Speciality Hospital** | **Malad Gymkhana** (Sports & Social) |\n| **St. Anne’s High School & Jr. College** | **Hayyat Multispeciality Hospital** | **Roaring Farm** (Adventure & Nature) |\n| **Shri Balaji International School** | **Raksha 24 Hrs Emergency Hospital** | **Agent Jacks / The Bar Stock Exchange** |\n| **Rejoice International School** | **Vinayak Maternity & General Hospital** | **Kora Kendra Grounds** (Cultural Events) |\n\n## **Who Will This Project Appeal To?**\n\n* Families seeking daily convenience and stable surroundings\n* Folks who do office jobs live out past the city center. Some take trains, others drive through quiet streets each morning\n* First-time buyers planning long-term ownership\n* Investors looking for c