](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Marina_Enclave_Elevation--1687947769005-img-1280w.webp)\n![Gurukrupa Marina Enclave Malad West - image 2](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Marina_Enclave_Exterior_View_--1687947798472-img-1280w.webp)\n![Gurukrupa Marina Enclave Malad West - image 3](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Marina_Enclave_Gymnasium--1687947798682-img-1280w.webp)\n![Gurukrupa Marina Enclave Malad West - image 4](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Marina_Enclave_Amenities--1687947814191-img-1280w.webp)\n![Gurukrupa Marina Enclave Malad West - image 5](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/Marina_Enclave_Pool--1687947814515-img-1280w.webp)\n\n20+ more\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Gurukrupa Marina Enclave\n\nExplore More Reels in Malad West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Gurukrupa Marina Enclave\n\nExplore More Reels in Malad West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\n## Gurukrupa Marina Enclave Overview\n\n![Land Parcel](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fland-parcel-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nLand Parcel\n\n![Towers](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-towers-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nTowers\n\n![Floors](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-floors-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nFloors\n\n![Config](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fconfig-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nConfig\n\n![Carpet Area](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fcarpet-area-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![RERA NO.](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-number-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nRERA NO.\n\n![Possession Status](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpossession-status-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nPossession Status\n\n![Target Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Ftarget-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nTarget Possession\n\n![RERA Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nRERA Possession\n\n![Litigation](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flitigation-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nLitigation\n\n### About Gurukrupa Marina Enclave\n\nGurukrupa Malad West Project Overview  \nGurukrupa Marina Enclave Project will be constructed on 10 acres of land parcel, 18 towers with G+1P+23/35 floors having 1BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK premium residences.  \n  \nGurukrupa Marina Enclave location  \nProject is located Near Malwani Church, Malad West, Mumbai with -  \nMarve Road - 2.8km  \nInfiniti Mall - 3.7km  \nMalad Railway Station - 5.0km  \n  \nGurukrupa Marina Enclave Malad Project Amenities  \nFirst is Internal amenities -  \nVitrified Tiles, Granite Platform, Power backup, SS sink & many more  \n  \nGurukrupa Group Malad West External Amenities  \nProject has 30+ luxurious amenities with likes of -  \nClub House  \nMultipurpose hall  \nGymnasium  \nBadminton court  \nSwimming pool & Many More  \n  \nGurukrupa Group Marina Enclave Malad West Parking -  \nProject has one type of car parking facility -  \n1) Podium  \n  \nGurukrupa Marina Enclave Possession -  \nRera Possession - December 2025  \nTarget Possession - Ready To Move  \n  \nCarpet Area & Floor Plan  \nMarina Enclave project has 1BHK, 2BHK, 3BHK premium residences with -  \n1BHK- 442 sqft  \n2BHK - (618 to 683) sqft  \n3BHK - (818 to 838) sqft  \n  \nGurukrupa Marina Enclave floor plan  \nTower floor plan will have 4 flats 2 lifts & 1 staircase on each floor  \n  \nMarina Enclave Malad West project sample flat is ready to view at the site.  \n  \nGurukrupa Marina Enclave Mumbai Prices & its details can be found in the price section & Gurukrupa Marina Enclave Malad West brochure can be downloaded from the link mentioned below. Project has been praised by the home buyers & Gurukrupa Group Malad West review is 4 out of 5 from over all the clients who have visited the site.\n\n## Gurukrupa Marina Enclave Location\n\nNear Malwani Church, Malad West, Mumbai\n\n![360 background](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2F360-background-image.webp&w=1280&q=75)\n![Housiey Logo](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Flogo1.png&w=256&q=75)\n![360](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2F360-tour-icon.png&w=128&q=75)\n\n## Gurukrupa Marina Enclave Videos\n\n## Gurukrupa Marina Enclave Pros & Cons\n\n![Pros-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-up-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nPros\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n![Cons-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nCons\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n## Gurukrupa Marina Enclave Amenities\n\n### Internal Amenities\n\n![Vitrified Tiles](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652438961711-img.webp)\n\nVitrified Tiles\n\n![Granite Kitchen Platform](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/granite-kitchen-platform_External_1770712604025-330259421.webp)\n\nGranite Kitchen Platform\n\n![Stainless Steel Sink](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1646987626444-img.webp)\n\nStainless Steel Sink\n\n### External Amenities\n\n![Swimming Pool](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652447054692-img.webp)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![Club House](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/club-house_External_1770724728916-59609935.webp)\n\nClub House\n\n![Kids Play Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446278292-img.webp)\n\nKids Play Area\n\n![Jogging Track](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/jogging-track_External_1770724897454-7779386.webp)\n\nJogging Track\n\n![Multi Purpose Court](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446516876-img.webp)\n\nMulti Purpose Court\n\n![Indoor Gym](h