 the top-quality projects developed by the famous developers Gurukrupa builders. Located in the popular area of this city Malad, this project has awesome homes in the size of 1, 2 and 3 BHK. Here the homes are developed as a part of 3 towers where total 258 units are crafted by expert engineers and architects. This grand project is developed on an area of 7.5 acres. The homes here are available in the area range of 452 sq ft to 937 sq ft where a small to large sized family can be easily accommodated. Malad is one of the known identities of this city where this project can help one to have easy and quality living for the lifetime. The dwellers here can easily get daily needed items from nearby areas of the project only whether one wants schools, colleges or hospitals etc.\n\nThe project **Gurukrupa Marina Enclave** is one of the top-quality projects developed by the famous developers Gurukrupa builders. Located in the popular area of this city Malad, this project has awesome homes in the size of 1, 2 and 3 BHK. Here the homes are developed as a part of 3 towers where total 258 units are crafted by expert engineers and architects. This grand project is developed on an area of 7.5 acres. The homes here are available in the area range of 452 sq ft to 937 sq ft where a small to large sized family can be easily accommodated. Malad is one of the known identities of this city where this project can help one to have easy and quality living for the lifetime. The dwellers here can easily get daily needed items from nearby areas of the project only whether one wants schools, colleges or hospitals etc.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg)\n![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg)\n![Gym](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804743_gym.svg)\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com