t and Malad East.\n\n... [Read More](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/malad-west/guide)\n\nMalad is home to renowned retail centres including Infinity Mall and Inorbit Mall. Marv Beach and Aksa Beach are only two of the beaches in Malad. The Malad Station is located on the West Line of the Mumbai Suburban Railway. To the north and south, respectively, are Kandivali Station and Goregaon Station. The Western Line railway divides Malad into Malad West and Malad East.\n\n## Explore Neighbourhoods of gurukrupa marina enclave, Malad West\n\n## College\n\n## Hospital\n\n## Police Station\n\n## Properties Price Trend in the Malad West\n\n## Similar Properties to Gurukrupa Marina Enclave in Malad West\n\n![KT Aqsa Palace](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/38875/KT_Aqsa_Palace_38875.jpeg)\n\n##### [KT Aqsa Palace](https://www.addressofchoice.com/kt-aqsa-palace-malad-west-mumbai-p38875)\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg) Malad West, Mumbai\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg)\n\n#### ₹ 90.07 Lakhs\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg \"Kids Play Area\")\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804694_sport-facility.svg \"Sports Facility\")\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg \"Swimming Pool\")\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg \"Car Parking\")\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804551_club-house.svg \"Club house\")\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg \"Lifts\")\n![Mittal Rahul Apartments](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/39119/1554269487_Mittal_Rahul_Apartments_Elevation_Image.jpg)\n\n##### [Mittal Rahul Apartments](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mittal-rahul-apartments-malad